@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@adminToken = change-me-in-production

### Checkout - sucesso (cartao comecando com 4 = aprovado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usr": "Guilherme",
  "eml": "gui@fullcycle.com.br",
  "pwd": "senhaforte",
  "c_id": 2,
  "card": "4111222233334444"
}

### Checkout - pagamento recusado (cartao nao comeca com 4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usr": "Joao",
  "eml": "joao@teste.com",
  "pwd": "123",
  "c_id": 1,
  "card": "5111222233334444"
}

### Relatorio financeiro administrativo (requer X-Admin-Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/financial-report
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### Relatorio financeiro SEM token (deve retornar 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/financial-report

### Deletar usuario (requer X-Admin-Token, cascateia enrollments e payments)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### Deletar usuario SEM token (deve retornar 401)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
